{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-markdown-remark-js","path":"/hitchhikers-guide/apps/docs/content/observatorium/thanos/request_grafana_access.md","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Operate First"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"8ba05522-4b9c-5ca0-8ddc-14f0a3520c74","html":"<h1 id=\"grafana\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#grafana\" aria-label=\"grafana permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Grafana</h1>\n<p>With Grafana access, you will be able to:</p>\n<ol class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li>Access the Grafana UI to visualize Operate First cluster metrics</li>\n<li>View saved metric visualization dashboards in Operate First Grafana instance</li>\n<li>Edit/Create new metric visualization dashboards in the Operate First Grafana instance</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"supported-roles\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#supported-roles\" aria-label=\"supported roles permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Supported Roles</h2>\n<p>We support three different roles for accessing the Operate First Grafana instance:</p>\n<ul class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li><strong>Viewer</strong>: User has view access to all the dashboards and metric/log datasources.</li>\n<li><strong>Editor</strong>: In addition to <em>Viewer</em> permissions, user can edit/create new visualization dashboards.</li>\n<li><strong>Admin</strong>: In addition to <em>Editor</em> permissions, user can manage Dashboards and Datasources.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>More information about these roles is available <a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/permissions/organization_roles/#compare-roles\">here</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"steps-to-follow\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#steps-to-follow\" aria-label=\"steps to follow permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Steps to follow</h2>\n<p>To get the specific permissions needed to get Grafana access, please follow these steps:</p>\n<ol class=\"pf-c-list\">\n<li>Onboard your project/group to Operate First (<a href=\"https://github.com/operate-first/hitchhikers-guide/blob/main/pages/onboarding_project.ipynb\">guide</a>).</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once your group has been onboarded, add your group and desired role to <a href=\"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/grafana/overlays/moc/smaug/grafana-oauth.yaml#L29\">this list</a> in a new line as: <br></p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">contains(groups[*], &#39;MY_GROUP_NAME&#39;)        &amp;&amp; &#39;MY_DESIRED_ROLE&#39; ||</code> <br></p>\n<p>and create a PR (Pull Request). You can see an example Pull Request <a href=\"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/pull/1323\">here</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>After your PR is reviewed/merged, you should have access to the Thanos Query Console and API.</li>\n</ol>","fields":{"srcLink":"https://github.com/operate-first/apps/blob/master/docs/content/observatorium/thanos/request_grafana_access.md"},"frontmatter":{"title":"","description":null,"extraClasses":null,"banner":null}}},"pageContext":{"id":"8ba05522-4b9c-5ca0-8ddc-14f0a3520c74"}},"staticQueryHashes":["117426894","1764348645","3000541721","3606484676"]}